                                "sense_id": "94652274-de36-3a55-9d26-c60cbde1c329",
                                "text": "The latest in this long line of winter journeyers is a British tenor, Mark Padmore, who sang Schubert’s song cycle at Weill Recital Hall on Tuesday night with the pianist Ethan Iverson."
                            }
                        ]
